# 01_prov.kzp -- the cFE 6.4.1 citations of profile c5-cfe-6.4.x: the ES files, whose lines differ between the
# releases.  Same names in cfe-6.4.1/ and cfe-6.4.2/ where the role is the same; a note names the release where the
# text differs (the lock scope of CFE_ES_AppCreate, the fix of Trac #41).  Paths, hashes: as in ../01_prov.kzp.
phi 1;

